      "updated": 1787379400235,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A sequential AI research workflow powered by LangChain and OpenRouter.\n\n1. Search Agent\nUses the Tavily web search tool to find recent sources, URLs and snippets.\n\n2. Reader Agent\nSelects a relevant URL and extracts readable content with Requests, Trafilatura, Readability and Beautiful Soup.\n\n3. Writer Chain\nCombines the search results and extracted content into a structured report with findings, conclusion and sources.\n\n4. Critic Chain\nReviews the report for factual quality, completeness, clarity, consistency and source quality, then returns a score and actionable feedback.\n\nThe Streamlit app presents the workflow interactively, while main.py exposes a scripted example.",
      "fontSize": 35.86093463712392,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A sequential AI research workflow powered by LangChain and OpenRouter. 1. Search Agent Uses the Tavily web search tool to find recent sources, URLs and snippets. 2. Reader Agent Selects a relevant URL and extracts readable content with Requests, Trafilatura, Readability and Beautiful Soup. 3. Writer Chain Combines the search results and extracted content into a structured report with findings, conclusion and sources. 4. Critic Chain Reviews the report for factual quality, completeness, clarity, consistency and source quality, then returns a score and actionable feedback. The Streamlit app presents the workflow interactively, while main.py exposes a scripted example.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
